stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> checked: fresh check
  checked --> planned: same filesystem admitted
  checked --> skipped: other filesystem
  skipped --> checked: explicit snapshot root
  planned --> started: journal target start
  started --> applied: record output then outcome
  started --> failed: closed failure
  started --> interrupted: process lost
  interrupted --> checked: explicit resume manifest
  applied --> restored: guarded rollback
  failed --> checked: explicit resume manifest
  restored --> [*]
  note right of planned
    Coverage and gaps persisted
    before target writes
    Key permission paths frozen
  end note
  note right of interrupted
    Unexpected edits refuse resume
    No implicit run selection
    Original key bytes required
    Interrupted chmod admits 0600
  end note
